- resolved: env.sh reads parse_example rows with IFS=$'\t', which collapses an empty targets field and drops the note; the new key carries an explicit `# [production,preview,development]` line so its note survives, and the template fault is parked as triage/template-change-env-audit-empty-targets.md.
